exec
/bin/bash -lc "sed -n '221,280p' /codex-home/skills/proving-spec/SKILL.md && sed -n '1,280p' /codex-home/skills/k-proof-technique/SKILL.md && sed -n '1,260p' /codex-home/skills/validating-proof/SKILL.md" in /workspace
 succeeded in 0ms:
  `[function]`/`[simplification]`, claim syntax, and labels.
- [Running the K tools](../shared/running-k.md) — build commands and result
