codex
The constructor conversion remains intentionally inert under `#iterNext`, so I’m adding the narrowest two-case iterator bridge. Per the contract, it will cover only `intVals(.IntSeq)` and `intVals(iCons(I, IS))`; I’m moving the conversion into an independent module and proving both bridge cases against that bridge-free module before using them.
apply patch
